         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Expanding\n\nTo compare on a broader level, we define objects by their main characteristics. For example, a circle is defined as:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><ul class=\"citation\"> <li>\"<i>A circle is a set of points in a plane, all at the same distance from a central point.</i>\"</li></ul></p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "25eb94f6-7947-4892-a078-c99d4445e77d",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "25eb94f6-7947-4892-a078-c99d4445e77d",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In general\n\nWith this broader definition, we can conclude that the circles below are the same figure, even with different colors.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><div class=\"htTwoGeometricalRectangle\"> <div class=\"htFirstGeometrical\"><div class=\"htCircle\" style=\"height: 12vh; width: 12vh;\"></div></div> <div class=\"htSecondGeometrical\"><div class=\"htCircle\" style=\"height: 12vh; width: 12vh; background-color: blue;\"></div></div> </div></p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
