        "source_menu": [],
        "text": [
          {
            "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we saw that comparing is not just about saying whether something is equal or different. Often, we need to look at specific characteristics rather than the whole.\n\nThis leads us to better define what it means to be equal — the topic of the next lesson.",
            "source": [],
            "date_time": null,
            "isTable": false,
            "imgdesc": "",
            "format": "markdown/html/text",
            "PostMention": ""
          }
